# Everything below stays local. docs/ holds the source PDFs and harvested
# answer keys (third-party material we don't redistribute); tools/ builds
# kpp/questions.js from them; SOURCES.md records where the key came from.
# Keep a backup of these — without them the question base cannot be rebuilt.
docs/
tools/
SOURCES.md
